  "id": "multiple-correlation-coefficient",
  "term": "multiple correlation coefficient",
  "definition": "A multiple correlation coefficient is a statistical value used in analyses with several related factors to show how strongly those factors, taken together, are associated with an outcome or score. In this study, it summarized how well the measured factors were related to teachers’ eHealth literacy.",
